From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:06:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/storage: Bound a unified VM image's content to the
 volume size
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The whole tarball was unpacked under the images directory before any
size was looked at, with only the compressed upload charged to the
project.

This addresses GHSA-9pvj-5r2h-r873 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 822bd634ec0b31c0d339a27944f318e68c83352a)
---
 internal/server/storage/utils.go | 57 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 57 insertions(+)

diff --git a/internal/server/storage/utils.go b/internal/server/storage/utils.go
index 86fc6c0b4f..5142da13a2 100644
--- a/internal/server/storage/utils.go
+++ b/internal/server/storage/utils.go
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ import (
 	"encoding/json"
 	"errors"
 	"fmt"
+	"io"
 	"io/fs"
 	"os"
 	"path/filepath"
@@ -39,6 +40,7 @@ import (
 	"github.com/lxc/incus/v7/shared/archive"
 	"github.com/lxc/incus/v7/shared/ioprogress"
 	"github.com/lxc/incus/v7/shared/logger"
